      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>This article is about quests issued travelers in <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a>. For the requests, see</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Requests\" title=\"Requests\">Requests</a><i>.</i></dd></dl>\n<p><b>Quests</b> are interactive tasks that can be performed to gain rewards. Quests are issued by <a href=\"/wiki/Travelers\" title=\"Travelers\">travelers</a>. When a <a href=\"/wiki/Request\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Request\">request</a> is issued, the current quest used to issue the request cannot be completed. After completing a quest, the traveler will gain experience and the player will receive some <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup\" title=\"Powerup\">powerups</a>, which vary depending on the traveler. Quests requirements depend on the traveler, and the level and type of potion is related to the experience gained.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Normal_Quests\">Normal Quests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FQuests%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After complete the normal quests, player have to wait 1 minute to receive the rewards (other actions are allowed). The rewards will be either 5 <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup#enhancement_failure_block\" title=\"Powerup\">enhancement failure block</a>, 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup#enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Powerup\">enhancement bonus</a> or 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup#Sell_bonus\" title=\"Powerup\">sell bonus</a>. The travelers will also gain experiences after the quests completed. The increase in level of travelers can unlock more <a href=\"/wiki/Requests\" title=\"Requests\">requests</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Challenge_Quest\">Challenge Quest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FQuests%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  \" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 64px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/d/d9/ChallengeQuestBorder.png/revision/latest?cb=20150721185502\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"This border appears around all challenge quest icons.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/d/d9/ChallengeQuestBorder.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150721185502\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"76\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"ChallengeQuestBorder.png\" data-image-key=\"ChallengeQuestBorder.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">This border appears around all challenge quest icons.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Challenge quests have a time limit of ten minutes<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>, rather then the normal quests. They can also be canceled with the Abandon button, something that cannot be done with normal quests. All challenge quests grant 10 <span class=\"mw-default-size mw-valign-top\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Likeability\" title=\"Likeability\"><img alt=\"Likeability\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/c/c8/Likeability.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/17?cb=20150721183219\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Likeability.png\" data-image-key=\"Likeability.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FQuests%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i> Help menu</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<table id=\"Stub\" class=\"noprint stub plainlinks\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><i>This article is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Stub\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:Stub\">stub</a>. You can help Potion Maker Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/Quests?action=edit&amp;useeditor=source\">expanding it</a>.</i>\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261012051411\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 48/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 487/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 392/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   11.649      1 -total\n 53.04%    6.178      1 Template:PM\n 17.68%    2.059      1 Template:Stub\n 13.73%    1.599      1 Template:Likeability\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_potionmaker783:pcache:idhash:2373-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261012051411 and revision id 5298. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
